-- limb (2) the company rejected the demand; limb (3) the company said it decided to file; the days since that notice with no filing; limb (4) the company did not answer as section 196 requires;
-- the organ's size, how many of it have a personal interest, a reasonable concern (limb (5): exempt from a demand); the claim was filed early; the court found that not filing then would bar it by prescription;
-- the court's two convictions.

